    "fc63014d": {
      "text": "接下来有三道听力题。听相关对话，在解答前选出答案。",
      "source_hash": "93538b29bd11"
    },
    "d8435642": {
      "text": "旅客应该去哪个区？",
      "source_hash": "98adac468c3e"
    },
    "29f6a979": {
      "text": "A. B 区",
      "source_hash": "5c31ddba6fe0"
    },
    "4a3c731c": {
      "text": "B. D 区",
      "source_hash": "6d276505008c"
    },
    "4b7d7794": {
      "text": "C. C 区",
      "source_hash": "049ef02687a6"
    },
    "717b3a05": {
      "text": "不好意思，这里是 Maple Airlines 的值机区吗？",
      "source_hash": "d224a6cb7331"
    },
    "63a84dd6": {
      "text": "不是。Maple Airlines 在 D 区，Delta 的 D。",
      "source_hash": "1e749ecc07c2"
    },
    "42785d9d": {
      "text": "现在选出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "1baec593": {
      "text": "请听出正确的柜台号码。",
      "source_hash": "abca2a4541ae"
    },
    "1248e8bf": {
      "text": "A. 13–16",
      "source_hash": "639e88d6fd24"
    },
    "d0635ad2": {
      "text": "C. 30–34",
      "source_hash": "aec04b02860f"
    },
    "922315fd": {
      "text": "我应该到哪几个柜台？",
      "source_hash": "7e6b15e67e12"
    },
    "a2061c61": {
      "text": "30到34号柜台。",
      "source_hash": "910bd46130ba"
    },
    "1818c1b7": {
      "text": "13号吗？",
      "source_hash": "1af31aca80dc"
    },
    "e4f42566": {
      "text": "不是，是30号，三、零。",
      "source_hash": "39b184623157"
    },
    "9df213aa": {
      "text": "现在选出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "3c424162": {
      "text": "答案是 C，30到34号。工作人员把13更正成30，并补充 three zero。",
      "source_hash": "295e6ed74aec"
    },
    "ffc0061e": {
      "text": "经过药店以后，要做什么？",
      "source_hash": "a657c9cbadec"
    },
    "214dd15d": {
      "text": "A. 右转",
      "source_hash": "2c459a680534"
    },
    "504366dd": {
      "text": "C. 上楼",
      "source_hash": "fd96f19f299e"
    },
    "999ac1e0": {
      "text": "我要怎么走到值机区？",
      "source_hash": "1a83ace576a9"
    },
    "6ce075f3": {
      "text": "直走经过药店，再右转。柜台在楼梯旁边。",
      "source_hash": "c53f48cc5fdd"
    },
    "28c292da": {
      "text": "现在选出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "92def519": {
      "text": "答案是 A，右转。next to the stairs 是在楼梯旁边，不是上楼。",
      "source_hash": "28964adc9cd8"
    },
    "62a7aea6": {
      "text": "最后用自然语速重听两段对话。想挑战自己，可以关闭翻译字幕，专心听声音。",
